      <activity id="091cfbfd-b297-55f3-99de-90ccca42ab55" activityNameId="afdb3ddd-c763-5416-bf96-a7999fcd3298" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">3kWp slanted-roof installation, ribbon-Si, laminated, integrated, on roof</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: 3kWp slanted-roof installation, ribbon-Si, laminated, integrated, on roof
Photovoltaic installation with a capacity of 3kWp and a life time of 30 years installed in CH.;
Synonyms: polycrystalline, multi-crystalline, silicon; 
UUID: 3b176199-fe1c-3d5a-8be1-00352bbc969f
All components for the installation of a 3kWp photovoltaic plant, energy use for the mounting, transport of materials and persons to the construction place. Disposal of components after end of life.
Location: Installation in CH
Technology: Current technology for mounting of panels or laminates, electric installations and other components.
Time period: Calculation of amount of panels used based on efficiency data for 2005. Other data are adopted.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Publication for efficiency, mounting systems and own estimations for other components. 
Extrapolations: Rough assumption for the decrease in material weights for mounting structures.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3b176199-fe1c-3d5a-8be1-00352bbc969f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="fdab769f-4bdb-5024-8349-c1745bbb2597" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
